  core/bluetooth/libs/HuaweiScale3BodyComposition.kt
  core/bluetooth/libs/HuaweiHagridWspLib.kt
  core/bluetooth/scales/HuaweiHagridWspHandler.kt

Changes in this project: port WSP framing and authentication to ESPHome/mbedTLS;
resolve GATT attributes by UUID; serialize CCCD subscriptions and writes;
publish atomic per-cycle measurements; limit final rereads to one per cycle;
add runtime provisioning; port body model coefficients to Python; add configurable
HA profiles, SQLite archive, conservative assignment, and archive-based trends.

Distributed binaries also incorporate ESPHome, ESP-IDF, mbedTLS, noise-c and
other dependencies under their respective upstream licenses. The project GPL
does not replace those notices. See docs/THIRD_PARTY.md and upstream distributions.

No keys, manufacturer credentials or measured health records are distributed.
Source for the project-specific firmware is included in firmware/ and tied to
the release Git tag. Body-composition output is an estimate, not medical advice.
